  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Spicy Bean Doner.png|200px|left|Spicy Bean Doner]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 32\n |price = 1 to 471\n |time = 30 min\n |source = {{Infoicon|donerkebabs|bigger|link=Doner Kebab Stand}}\n |xp = 56\n |base = 131\n |dia = 3\n |time3 = 25 min\n}}\n'''Spicy Bean Doner''' is a [[products]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 32. \n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making Spicy Bean Doner'''===\n[[File:Doner Kebab Stand.png|150px|left|Doner Kebab Stand]]\nSpicy Bean Doner is made in the [[Doner Kebab Stand]].\n\nTo make the Spicy Bean Doner, players need the following ingredient, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Black Bean.png|75px|Black bean|link=Black Bean]]\n|[[File:Chili Pepper.png|75px|Chili Pepper|link=Chili Pepper]]\n|[[File:Cheese.png|75px|Cheese|link=Cheese]]\n|[[File:Corn Bread.png|75px|Corn Bread|link=Corn Bread]]\n|-\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 30 minutes to make one wrap, and 25 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] stand. Each wrap gives players 56 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling Spicy Bean Doner'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside Shop]]\n* Spicy Bean Doner can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 4,716 {{Infoicon|coin}} for 10 items.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make the Spicy Bean Doner costs 445 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for ? to ? Spicy Bean Doner per crate, up to a total of ? per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Scharfer Bohnen-Döner\n|es = Kebab de frijoles picante\n|fr = \n|it = \n|nl = \n|no = Krydret bønnedöner\n|ru = Острая шаурма с бобами\n|zh = \n}}\n[[pt-br:Kebab de feijão picante]]\n\n[[Category:Doner Kebab Stand Products]]\n[[Category:Black Bean Products]]\n[[Category:Chili Pepper Products]]\n[[Category:Cheese Products]]\n[[Category:Corn Bread Products]]",
